WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.650
Guile approaches standing Marisa with raw Drive Rush.

2
00:00:00.650 --> 00:00:01.270
Crouching medium kick hits Marisa low.

3
00:00:01.270 --> 00:00:01.650
Crouching light punch links after the Rush low.

4
00:00:01.650 --> 00:00:02.150
The first Perfect light Sonic Boom hits.

5
00:00:02.150 --> 00:00:02.650
Crouching medium punch links between the first two Booms.

6
00:00:02.650 --> 00:00:03.150
The second Perfect light Sonic Boom hits.

7
00:00:03.150 --> 00:00:03.650
Back heavy punch links before the third Boom.

8
00:00:03.650 --> 00:00:04.300
The third Perfect light Sonic Boom continues the loop.

9
00:00:04.300 --> 00:00:05.850
Standing heavy kick reaches after the third Boom.

10
00:00:05.850 --> 00:00:07.150
Heavy Sonic Hurricane ends the loop.

11
00:00:07.150 --> 00:00:07.500
Marisa lands near the corner after Sonic Hurricane.
